bind Equipment Request: ID Request
bind Request Approve: Status Approval
bind Equipment Order: Cost Equipment
bind Equipment Inspect: Condition Equipment, Score Inspection
bind Staff Train: Hours Training
bind Equipment Install: Status Installation
bind Equipment Maintain: Status Maintenance
bind Equipment Decommission: Reason Decommission
bind Equipment Use: Frequency Usage
ID Request: integer between 1 and 10000
Cost Equipment: float between 100.0 and 100000.0
Status Approval: Pending, Approved, Rejected
Condition Equipment: New, Good, Damaged
Hours Training: integer between 1 and 40
Status Installation: Not Started, In Progress, Completed
Status Maintenance: Up to Date, Due, Overdue
Frequency Usage: integer between 0 and 100
Reason Decommission: Obsolete, Faulty, Replaced
Score Inspection: float between 0.0 and 10.0
